# MASTER FULL-STACK DEVELOPMENT PROMPT
## AI-Powered Handwritten Notes & Academic Learning Platform — Sarve Vidhya

Act as a senior full-stack software engineer, AI application architect, educational content specialist, digital handwriting rendering engineer, database architect, and academic quality auditor.

Your task is to thoroughly inspect, improve, and complete the existing Sarve Vidhya application. Build a fully functional, production-oriented educational platform that generates comprehensive, academically accurate study notes in the style of ChatGPT explanations, but visually presented as realistic handwritten notebook notes.

The platform must combine the explanatory quality of ChatGPT, the visual appearance of handwritten school notes, the accuracy of NCERT and other reliable textbooks, a complete class-wise academic library, interactive handwritten diagrams, personalized student dashboards, and reliable examination reminders.

This is a full-stack development task. Implement the frontend, backend, database models, AI integration, content verification, handwriting renderer, diagram engine, authentication, persistent storage, and automated testing. Do not deliver only a UI redesign, static prototype, mock API, or demonstration.

**The primary objective is to generate notes that explain concepts as clearly as ChatGPT while looking as though a real student or teacher wrote them by hand in a notebook.**

